From: ephico2real2 <ephico2real@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:31:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ztunnel: gate CNI creation on acknowledged capture

Require fresh Kubernetes namespace and Pod identity plus capture and a fresh ZDS ACK before strict-profile endpoint API creation succeeds. Propagate errors through the existing CNI failure/cleanup path and emit bounded retry and terminal structured logs. Compatibility mode retains its existing behavior.

Local Linux ARM64 qualification: 64 top-level tests and 69 subtests with the race detector, no skips; vet and pinned configured lint pass. This remains experimental: sandbox failure/recovery, UID-aware cleanup, restore and dynamic intent transitions require separate qualification.

Signed-off-by: ephico2real2 <ephico2real@gmail.com>
