Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:47:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ztunnel: retire deleted endpoint incarnations without
 removing capture

Bind fresh CNI metadata enrollment to the managed endpoint lifetime. Retire exact cache ownership before bounded cleanup waits and again after active ADD completion; skip stale DEL when a newer sandbox owns the Pod UID. Keep deleted sandbox capture installed and avoid replaying retired namespaces.

Validated locally with pinned Podman Go 1.27.1 ARM64: 139 affected unit/race cases, 49 actual ZDS socket/privileged cases with zero skips, vet and configured lint. Exact-image kind CNI failure and recovery qualification remains the next gate.

